@* _Imports.razor — LiPi.Components project-wide Razor usings
   PHASE: 2.8 Migration Stage 1 (A44)

   When the input/selection family migrated from LiPi.Web into this project, the
   .razor components lost access to the framework namespaces that LiPi.Web's own
   _Imports/global-usings had provided. The extension methods IsDevelopment()
   (Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting) and the ILogger Log* methods
   (Microsoft.Extensions.Logging) are the ones that broke. This file restores them
   project-wide so every .razor in LiPi.Components resolves them.

   Kept deliberately minimal — only framework namespaces every component may need.
   Component cross-references resolve via their own @namespace LiPi.Components
   (Forms) / LiPi.Components.DataDisplay declarations + explicit @using where needed. *@

@using System
@using System.Collections.Generic
@using System.Linq
@using System.Threading.Tasks
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Forms
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using static Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web.RenderMode
@using Microsoft.JSInterop
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Options
@using LiPi.Components.Forms
@using LiPi.Components.Feedback
@using LiPicons.Blazor
